73
00:05:56.522 --> 00:06:02.897
NARRATOR: Dynamic programming records
solutions to overlapping subproblems.

74
00:06:02.897 --> 00:06:10.647
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: The
Fibonacci sequence uses memoization to store

75
00:06:10.647 --> 00:06:14.522
